  "result": "All 617 tests pass. The fix: `findIssueById` in `src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts` was querying by `issues.id` alone, ignoring the `orgId` parameter it received — so any valid issue id resolved regardless of which organization it belonged to. Added the same `orgPredicate(issues.orgId, orgId)` filter that its sibling `findIssueByNumber` already uses, so a cross-tenant id now resolves to `null` at the repository layer, matching the invariant documented in `src/lib/tenant.ts`.",
